\item (246.41)对下列 $K$ 和 $L$, $f^{0}$ 决定单纯映射 $f$, 试求 $f$ 的诱导同态 $f_{*p}: H_p(K)\to H_p(L)$：
\begin{itemize}
\item[(1)] $K=\operatorname{Bd}(a_0,a_1,a_2,a_3)=L,\ f^{0}(a_0)=a_0,\ f^{0}(a_1)=a_1,\ f^{0}(a_2)=a_3,\ f^{0}(a_3)=a_2;$\\
\item[(2)] $K$ 和 $L$ 是如下图所示的 $1$ 维复形, $f^{0}(a_i)=b_i\ (0\leqslant i\leqslant4),\ f^{0}(a_5)=b_0$.
\end{itemize}
\begin{center}
\begin{tikzpicture}[line join=round,line cap=round,thick,every node/.style={font=\small}]
